        "TileImage": "$($repository 90505cde-9b68-488f-827b-ff81498264aa).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47.\rWe have been tasked with the elimination of Charles Blake III, a politician currently campaigning in Whittleton Creek, Vermont.\rAccording to the local resident, Blake has been ruling the town as a tyrant. He has been forbidding numerous things, no matter how petty it may seem.\rThe client, a political rival, wants his enemy&apos;s political career put to an end.\rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47, I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
